 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "A mention token starts with \"@\" at the start of a message or right after a space and ends before the next space or at the end. Its body is either comma-separated user ids \"id<k>\" (k from 1 to 999, no leading zero) or the word \"all\" (inferred), which covers every member. An \"@\" inside a word is ignored. Return, aligned with members, the number of messages that mention each member at least once. Ids not in members are ignored.",
